{"id":"f32a973b59a825e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-homomorphism.md","title":"Homomorphism","display":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homomorphism","aliases":["58-df-homomorphism","Homomorphism"],"display":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-df-group]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homomorphism</span><span>Homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H,\\phi\\in V\">\\(G,H,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H,\\phi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\phi,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land\\phi:G\\to H\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;(\\phi(a\\cdot_G b)=\\phi(a)\\cdot_H\\phi(b))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\phi,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land\\phi:G\\to H\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;(\\phi(a\\cdot_G b)=\\phi(a)\\cdot_H\\phi(b))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homomorphism: structure-preserving map</li>\n<li>Isomorphism: bijective homomorphism</li>\n<li>Kernel: normal subgroup, measures failure to be injective</li>\n<li>Isomorphism theorems: fundamental structure decomposition</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Hungerford, Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,H,\\cdot_G,\\cdot_H,\\phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\phi,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land\\phi:G\\to H\\land\\forall a,b\\in G\\;(\\phi(a\\cdot_G b)=\\phi(a)\\cdot_H\\phi(b))","display":true}],"bytes":967,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8ff8ac112a08548